  "description": "Document geofencing endpoints for a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge web app, backed by Shiny.DocumentDb.Geofencing — GPS-driven monitoring of an unlimited number of polygon and proximity regions stored as documents, the regions the device is in, and enter/exit changes delivered to the page as events and to background.js. One call: bridge.AddDocumentGeofenceBridge(cfg => cfg.AddRegionSet<T>(…)).",
